 ittle used route for a coffee/washroom break at the Rosemont Cafe. The ret
 urn route also has some new portions for a total distance of about 25 kms\
 , finishing at High Park around noon. This is an Urban Roller level ride. 
 If you are uncertain whether this level is appropriate to your riding leve
