UID:dff2d856df8168f894909976cf5ce814@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:The ride starts in Inglewood\, just off of Hwy 10. We begin ri
 ding east on the Caledon Trailway Path\, crossing over Hwy 10 on the pedes
 trian bridge over the highway. Then a bit of escarpment country and a shor
 t stretch of gravel on Escarpment Sideroad as we head west\, skirting past
  Belfountain on the way to lunch at the Tin Roof Cafe in Erin. Dipping sou
 thwards\, we pass through Cheltenham\, then take Boston Mills Rd back to I
 nglewood. Start location : Lloyd Wilson Centennial Arena in Inglewood. Bik
 e route : Ingelwood to Erin 71 km There are 16 km of gravel roads + trails
  on this route. Ride Leader : Dave Mader Only registrants are permitted to
  join the ride. If have registered and then find ou...
URL:https://www.tbn.ca/event-6592489
X-SOURCE:Toronto Bicycling Network
