UID:165fd90c4b838fb5207fd704110f7a6c@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:May Dining Out: Chinese On Thursday\, May 21\, we will be vent
 uring into Chinatown as we visit an extraordinary and iconic Chinese resta
 urant. House of Gourmet has been serving great Chinese food for almost thr
 ee decades. We have reserved a huge round table with a rotating turntable 
 - perfect for sharing dishes. House of Gourmet is a bustling Chinatown ins
 titution serving wonton noodles\, late night Chinese BBQ and other Cantone
 se classics. Sitting four steps up from Dundas Street\, this iconic dining
  room and its lovably brusque servers have been feeding diners from mornin
 g ‘til owl hours for nearly three decades. Known for its quick service a
 nd massive menu—around 800 items spread between two...
LOCATION:484 Dundas St
URL:https://www.tbn.ca/event-6657793
X-SOURCE:Toronto Bicycling Network
END:VEVENT
