DESCRIPTION:Please note ride starts at 8:30AM! Starting in King City\, you
 'll tackle some hills up Keele St before the flats of the Holland Marsh. O
 ur return route includes a section of Keele St\, before you head west to t
 he bakery in Kettleby for our lunch/break stop\, before the final leg alon
 g Jane St through the estates of King City. The longer route goes to Schom
 berg with a rest stop at Grackles . After-ride coffee stop is the popular 
 Roost Cafe on the west side of Keele Street\, just south of King Road. Thi
 s is a Tourist level ride. If you are uncertain whether this level is appr
 opriate to your riding level\, click here .
