UID:b296beffb8bb9fc4883d3ca7106baf8d@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:Saturday Morning at Tigchelaar Farm We ride on some of the nic
 est backroads in Escarpment Country\, and then arrive at the park-like Tig
 chelaar Farm Market. This farm market has plenty of outdoor tables and cha
 irs under a canopy of trees. They have coffee made from direct-trade Nicar
 aguan beans that they roast on-site. They have butter tarts ( perennial pl
 easers )\, fruit pastries\, and scones. They have a story spanning the Net
 herlands\, Canada\, and Nicaragua. Take a look at Jo Koga's blog on this r
 ide - click here . This ride takes us from the Campbellville CarPool lot t
 o Puslinch through the rolling countryside around Campbellville. Lunch is 
 at the Tigchelaar Farm Market (268 Puslinch Townlin...
